	<!-- ============================================================
	     Spell book restyled to match the Alternate Advancement window
	     - real rounded window frame with a "Spell Book" title bar, ? and close boxes
	       (replaces the baked-in background picture)
	     - each page sits in a dark AA list panel (244 x 277) with a small gold PAGE caption
	       and the page number; 6px margins and gutters throughout
	     - 8 rows per page: the game itself fills each row slate (beneficial) or red (detrimental);
	       the spell names are drawn above the rows so that fill can't dim them
	     - footer: "< Prev" / "Next >" in the AA button style, memorize / scribe bar centred
	     ============================================================ -->
